[31m-[![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/zeit/ms.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/zeit/ms)[m
[31m-[![Slack Channel](http://zeit-slackin.now.sh/badge.svg)](https://zeit.chat/)[m
