[31m-[m
[31m-1. [Fork](https://help.github.com/articles/fork-a-repo/) this repository to your own GitHub account and then [clone](https://help.github.com/articles/cloning-a-repository/) it to your local device[m
[31m-2. Link the package to the global module directory: `npm link`[m
